    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know what im doing anymore. it’s just… the same thing every single day. cleaning, feeding, watching them fade away bit by bit. it feels like i've been holding my breath for months and i'm just waiting for it to finally be over. part of me feels like i'm already gone, just a ghost moving through the house.",
